# AlQuranPlusAI - Comprehensive Manual Test Plan (Extended)

**Application**: AlQuran Plus AI
**Version**: 1.0
**Target OS**: Android (Primary), iOS (via Shared Logic verification)
**Last Updated**: December 31, 2025
**Total Test Cases**: 150+

---

## 🟢 Phase 1: Onboarding & Authentication

### 1.1 Fresh Install & Launch
- [ ] **TC-001**: Launch app for the first time. Verify **Splash Screen** appears with correct branding.
- [ ] **TC-002**: Verify transition to **Onboarding Screen**.
- [ ] **TC-003**: Swipe through Onboarding slides (Features intro: Reading, Audio, AI). Verify animations/text.
- [ ] **TC-004**: Click "Get Started" on the final slide.

### 1.2 Authentication Flow
- [ ] **TC-005**: Verify **Auth/Welcome Screen** appears.
- [ ] **TC-006**: Test **Sign Up** with valid email/password. Verify success and navigation to Profile Setup.
- [ ] **TC-007**: Test **Sign Up** with invalid email (e.g., missing @). Verify error message.
- [ ] **TC-008**: Test **Login** with valid credentials.
- [ ] **TC-009**: Test **Login** with incorrect password. Verify error toast/dialog.
- [ ] **TC-010**: Test **Skip/Guest Mode**. Verify access to Home Screen.

### 1.3 Initial Setup (After Auth)
- [ ] **TC-011**: Verify **Permissions Request** screen (Notification, Storage/Media).
- [ ] **TC-012**: Deny permissions and verify app handling (graceful degradation explanation).
- [ ] **TC-013**: Grant permissions.
- [ ] **TC-014**: Verify **Setup Complete** / Loading Quran Data screen. Ensure loading bar progresses.

