## 🟢 Phase 11: Edge Cases & Stability

### 11.1 Network Handling
- [ ] **TC-174**: Turn off internet. Open app. Verify "Offline Mode" banner/snackbar.
- [ ] **TC-175**: Try to stream audio without internet. Verify error message "Connect to internet".
- [ ] **TC-176**: Try to search (AI mode) without internet. Verify fallback to local text search.
- [ ] **TC-177**: Turn internet back on. Verify app resumes normal operation.

### 11.2 Lifecycle & State
- [ ] **TC-178**: Background Play → Kill App from Recents. Verify Audio stops.
- [ ] **TC-179**: Rotate Screen. Verify Layout adapts (especially Reading Screen).
- [ ] **TC-180**: Change System Language (e.g., to Arabic). Verify App UI mirrors (RTL) if supported.
- [ ] **TC-181**: Low memory scenario. Verify app doesn't crash.

### 11.3 Data Persistence
- [ ] **TC-182**: Close app. Reopen. Verify last read position is saved.
- [ ] **TC-183**: Close app. Reopen. Verify bookmarks are persisted.
- [ ] **TC-184**: Close app. Reopen. Verify settings are persisted.
- [ ] **TC-185**: Close app. Reopen. Verify quiz progress is saved.

### 11.4 Performance
- [ ] **TC-186**: Scroll through long Surah (Al-Baqarah). Verify smooth scrolling.
- [ ] **TC-187**: Search with many results. Verify results load efficiently.
- [ ] **TC-188**: Open app cold start. Verify reasonable launch time.

### 11.5 Error Handling
- [ ] **TC-189**: Invalid search query. Verify graceful error handling.
- [ ] **TC-190**: Corrupted audio file. Verify error message.
- [ ] **TC-191**: Database error. Verify app doesn't crash.

